# spring-webmvc 6.2.x has no open-source fix for these; the fixed line is 7.0.x (Spring Boot 4).
# CVE-2026-47884 needs XsltView, which the app never renders.
# CVE-2026-47890 needs view fragments streamed over SSE. The run event stream uses SseEmitter, but every
# event is a numeric id, an enum name and Jackson-encoded JSON data, so no view fragments are rendered and
# client data cannot inject CRLF into the stream.
# Revisit when moving to Boot 4.
CVE-2026-47884
CVE-2026-47890
